e have to change the way that they  play and you're making them do that and  speaking of changing the game we  couldn't have this talk without bringing  this up john tortorella his comments on  you i'm sure you saw them what are your  thoughts on what he had to say  yeah i mean i thought it was uh  definitely a little uh out of the  ordinary um because where i always like  torts man like growing up i was a big  ranger fan obviously he coached the  rangers um so i was always a big  tortorella fan i love kind of that he  was a little bit outspoken and had his  own opinion um and sonny sonny played  for him for five years and sunny had  nothing but great things to say about  him  so i guess for him to kind of  take that goal i don't know if he took  it personal or what not  but it was definitely  definitely a little out of the ordinary  for sure and um i guess like you said i  don't know changing the game man like i  saw so many so many awesome videos of  little kids trying it or um i guess  whether it was college kids or whatnot  so i mean to me personally i took a lot  of pride in i guess maybe trying to  inspire somebody to pick up a hockey  stick um but i guess if he wanted to  take it as it was bad for the game i  guess that's just his opinion  yeah i can really respect that answer i  don't think torts meant any you know ill  intent by that he's just old school you  know dump the puck low shoot low for  rebounds that's that's the kind of guy  he is but yeah i could say personally i  walked into my rink for a beer league  game this week no joke i saw the guys  flipping the puck with the net going for  your play so you're inspiring the youth  around the country man i appreciate  everything you're doing changing the  game of hockey and that we appreciate  you hopping on this interview  thanks nash right i picked up some stuff  watching you on youtube bro  oh no you did not yeah i saw you i saw  your roller hockey highlights bro that's  where my uh where some of the eggs comes  from you've got to be kidding me i  posted that and i thought i was just  kind of making a joke i didn't know you  actually watched the videos  of course man dude i appreciate the love  thank you so much and uh best of luck  going forward this year man thanks man  appreciate it
 

